# Format + lint the staged files only — fast enough to run on every commit.
#
# Deliberately does NOT rewrite files: an auto-fix that runs after `git add`
# either commits unstaged edits or silently drops them. Fail loudly instead and
# let `pnpm format` do the writing.
#
# This is a fast pre-filter, not the merge gate — CI runs the full gate.
pnpm biome check --staged --no-errors-on-unmatched
